    skos:altLabel "Environmental Systems Research Institute binary grid"@en ;
    skos:definition "Esri binary grid is a proprietary binary variation of an Esri grid, a raster GIS file format developed by Esri. It is also known as an ARC/INFO GRID or ARC GRID. It differs from the other Esri grid variation, a non-proprietary ASCII format."@en ;
