    skos:altLabel "Standard Generalized Mark-up Language"@en ;
    skos:definition "SGML – Standard Generalized Markup Language – is a standard for defining generalized markup languages for documents. Generalized markup is based on two postulates: markup should be declarative and rigorous."@en ;
